# Cloudflare Pages headers config.
#
# IMPORTANT: CF Pages CONCATENATES header values across matching rules.
# Previously a /* wildcard + /*.json rule resulted in BOTH Cache-Control
# values being sent (browser took the first = max-age=0 = no cache).
# Use most-specific rules only; do NOT use /* unless you actually want it
# to apply to everything additively.

/*.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, must-revalidate
  X-Bpleone-Version: 2026.5.18-r5

/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  X-Bpleone-Version: 2026.5.18-r5

/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  X-Bpleone-Version: 2026.5.18-r5

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  X-Bpleone-Version: 2026.5.18-r5

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  X-Bpleone-Version: 2026.5.18-r5
